  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EMPOWER: Enabling and mobilising the participation of women in environmental rights defence</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to piloting a contextually appropriate approach to address the safety concerns of Women Environmental Human Rights Defenders (WEHRDs) and supporting Village Land and Forestry Committees (VLFCs) to establish and enabling environment for the uptake of protective measures, thereby fostering the continued participation of women in natural resource management (NRM).</narrative>
  </description>
